        <profile name="Puppet Master" typeId="058c-866b-6487-ccc4" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="160b-ac27-f0d8-ebc8">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">Puppet Master ACTION: A Heretic Captain can take a Puppet Master ACTION. If they do so, take a Risky Success Roll for the model. If the roll is a Failure, the Heretic Captain&apos;s Activation ends immediately. If the roll is a Success or Critical Success, pick 1 model (friend or foe) that is within 12&quot; of the Heretic Captain and in their Line of Sight, apart from the Heretic Captain themselves. You can move the model D6&quot;. The move must be in a straight line, but can be in any direction, and can be used to make the model move within 1&quot; of an enemy, make a retreat move, Climb, Jump, or Jump Down. The model cannot make a Diving Charge and does not count as charging if it finishes the move within 1&quot; of an enemy model.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
